A dynamic, stylized logo that represents the NFT Flip Alert app. The design features a bold, upward‑pointing arrow that splits into two smaller arrows, symbolizing the concept of flipping and profit. The arrows are rendered in a gradient of electric blue and neon green, giving a futuristic, digital feel. Behind the arrows is a subtle, abstract representation of a blockchain network, depicted as a series of interconnected hexagons in a muted gray. The background is a deep navy gradient that fades from dark at the top to slightly lighter at the bottom, creating depth. The overall composition is clean and modern, with a slight 3D effect to make the arrows pop. The logo should be easily recognizable at small sizes and convey the idea of real‑time market tracking and quick, profitable trades.
